---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import InquiryForm from '../components/InquiryForm.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { newsletterUrl } from '../lib/config';
---
<Layout title="Stay connected"><PageIntro eyebrow="A little hope in your inbox" title="Good things are growing." description="Stay close to the ideas, community-led projects, and practical possibilities behind a more abundant Earth." />
  <section class="section container two-column"><div class="prose"><h2>Stories that connect us.</h2><p>AEF’s newsletter has been a way to share project stories and connect supporters with the work. Ask to hear about future updates and opportunities to take part.</p><ul><li>People and projects from the grassroots network.</li><li>Regenerative growing and learning opportunities.</li><li>Ways to support and participate.</li></ul><p>Your interest in updates should always be your choice. A giving or project inquiry does not subscribe you to a mailing list.</p><a class="text-link" href="/resources/newsletters/">Read the recovered newsletter archive <Icon /></a></div>
  {newsletterUrl ? <div class="form-card"><p class="eyebrow">Stay in the loop</p><h2>Join the newsletter.</h2><p>Continue to AEF’s verified signup provider to enter your email and confirm your subscription. Subscription status is managed by that provider.</p><a class="button" href={newsletterUrl}>Go to newsletter signup <Icon /></a><p class="form-help" style="margin-top:20px">Review the provider’s privacy information and any confirmation email before subscribing.</p></div> : <div><div class="notice" style="margin-bottom:25px"><strong>The original signup destination is unavailable.</strong>The Mailchimp endpoint published on the original website returned HTTP 404 when checked on September 18, 2026. Ask the team for the current signup link using the email helper below. This website does not collect subscribers or claim that you have been subscribed.</div><InquiryForm topic="Newsletter" compact /></div>}
  </section>
</Layout>
